# Master list of this challenge's flags (dummy values). Copy to .env (git-ignored).
# With DYNAMIC_FLAGS=true each team gets "_xxxx" appended before the closing brace, and flags are
# checked inside the app. With DYNAMIC_FLAGS=false these exact values go in your scoreboard (e.g. CTFd).
